
"smart_sources:ServiceNowOfficialDocs/support-and-troubleshooting/it-operations-management/KB0748158 - Google - GCP Pattern Discovery Errors.md": {"path":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/support-and-troubleshooting/it-operations-management/KB0748158 - Google - GCP Pattern Discovery Errors.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"7zq9uc","at":1784561349614},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1783354428471,"size":4721,"at":1784561349615,"hash":"7zq9uc"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,11],"##Google - GCP Pattern Discovery Errors":[13,18],"##Google - GCP Pattern Discovery Errors#Issue":[17,18],"#Overview":[19,36],"#Overview#{1}":[21,22],"#Overview#{2}":[23,34],"#Overview#{3}":[35,36],"#Issue / Error":[37,43],"#Issue / Error#{1}":[39,40],"#Issue / Error#{2}":[41,43],"#Release":[44,47],"#Release#{1}":[46,47],"#Environment":[48,51],"#Environment#{1}":[50,51],"#Cause":[52,55],"#Cause#{1}":[54,55],"#Resolution":[56,109],"#Resolution#{1}":[58,59],"#Resolution#{2}":[60,61],"#Resolution#{3}":[62,65],"#Resolution#{4}":[66,67],"#Resolution#{5}":[68,81],"#Resolution#{6}":[82,83],"#Resolution#{7}":[84,85],"#Resolution#{8}":[86,87],"#Resolution#{9}":[88,91],"#Resolution#{10}":[92,92],"#Resolution#{11}":[93,93],"#Resolution#{12}":[94,95],"#Resolution#{13}":[96,97],"#Resolution#{14}":[98,99],"#Resolution#{15}":[100,101],"#Resolution#{16}":[102,103],"#Resolution#{17}":[104,105],"#Resolution#{18}":[106,107],"#Resolution#{19}":[108,109],"#Additional Information":[110,114],"#Additional Information#{1}":[112,112],"#Additional Information#{2}":[113,114]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Google Cloud Platform discovery","target":"https://docs.servicenow.com/csh?topicname=gcp-cloud-discovery.html&version=latest \"Google Cloud Platform discovery\"","line":21},{"title":"Vary: X-Origin, Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8, \n\n# Release\n\n-   As per the Documentation, GCP discovery is supported from London P7 and Madrid P2\n\n# Environment\n\n-   Instance installed with the application \"Discovery and Service Mapping Patterns\"\n\n# Cause\n\n-   The pattern failure because of mismatch in the GCP Credentials.\n\n# Resolution\n\n-   Configuring GCP API Credentials needs below information.\n\n\"https://<Instancename>.service-now.com/gcp\\_credentials.do\"\n\n-   -   Client\\_email  = Email \n    -   Secret\\_Key   = Secret Key  \n          \n        \n-   Above both of the details will be populated while creating the ServiceAccount in GCP and the output of JSON will be as below \n\n{\n  \"type\": \"service\\_account\",\n  \"project\\_id\": \"_project-id_\",\n  \"private\\_key\\_id\": \"_some\\_number_\",\n  \"**private\\_key**\": \"-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\\\\n....\n  =\\\\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----\\\\n\",\n  \"**client\\_email**\": \"<api-name>api@_project-id_.iam.gserviceaccount.com\",\n  \"client\\_id\": \"...\",\n  \"auth\\_uri\": \"https://accounts.google.com/o/oauth2/auth\",\n  \"token\\_uri\": \"https://accounts.google.com/o/oauth2/token\",\n  \"auth\\_provider\\_x509\\_cert\\_url\": \"https://www.googleapis.com/oauth2/v1/certs\",\n  \"client\\_x509\\_cert\\_url\": \"https://www.googleapis.com/...<api-name>api%40_project-id_.iam.gserviceaccount.com\"\n}\n\n-   From the above output of JSON, we need \"Private\\_Key\" and \"Client\\_Email\" \n\n-   Configuring GCP ServiceAccount needs below information.\n\n\"https://<Instancename>.service-now.com/cmdb\\_ci\\_cloud\\_service\\_account.do\"\n\n-   -   Account ID = Project name \n    -   Credentials = Which we created as above (GCP API)\n    -   Datacenter = Always \"cmdb\\_ci\\_google\\_datacenter\" \n\n-   The Account ID is the Project name, while creating a ServiceAccount for \"Private\\_Key\" and \"Client\\_Email\" it initially requests on which Project user wanted to create.\n-   The Credentials we must have created for the Project name since the reason the Project name will not be available in above JSON\n-   Admin need to validate the credentials with project name with project ID provided in the JSON \n\n-   Configuring GCP Patterns at Serverless discovery.\n\nhttps://<instacnename>.service-now.com/discovery\\_schedule\\_list.do?sysparm\\_query=discover%3DHostless&sysparm\\_first\\_row=1&sysparm\\_view=\n\n-   Navigator >> Discovery Schedule >> GCP Serverless Schedule >> Serverless Execution Patterns \n\n![","target":"/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=218e3862db0ab450e515c223059619d3","line":42},{"title":"Authenticating to a Cloud API Service","target":"https://cloud.google.com/video-intelligence/docs/common/auth \"Authenticating to a Cloud API Service\"","line":112}],"metadata":{"title":"Google - GCP Pattern Discovery Errors  ","aliases":["KB0748158"],"tags":["#servicenow","#support-kb"],"source_url":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0748158","kb_number":"KB0748158","last_modified":"2024-04-07"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:ServiceNowOfficialDocs/support-and-troubleshooting/it-operations-management/KB0748158 - Google - GCP Pattern Discovery Errors.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1k9tdi0","at":1784561349614},"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/support-and-troubleshooting/it-operations-management/KB0748158 - Google - GCP Pattern Discovery Errors.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,11],"size":253,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
